expect: 2f326c46-ac3d-42a8-a4d0-08deb9658cc1, f29bc176-82b1-46b0-a4d1-08deb9658cc1, 4a02258e-79c1-4911-a4d2-08deb9658cc1, 8f8a357c-0c04-47c9-a4d3-08deb9658cc1, 5fc80a2a-3ba5-4303-a4d4-08deb9658cc1, f003d8db-8721-41e7-a4d5-08deb9658cc1
why: The indicator name, carried on six details and on no row of its own. Any of the six is a defensible hit; none of them is *the* answer, which is Story 2.4's problem, not 2.2's.

