expect: b825d0f0-08ee-4e95-9654-08de66e6ef19
why: Minimum Reserves -- "Oil", whose Arabic name زيت الطعام says cooking oil while its English name says "Oil". An English question about crude would be the wrong answer and an English match on "Oil" is how it happens.

